+ * visibility, layer opacity and labels of the project layers (the cadastral
+ * layers first). Changes apply at once and are remembered on the device.
+ *
+ * "ნაგულისხმევი" — the values new features receive (TAG, village status,
+ * survey type...), stored as QField global variables.
+ */
+Item {
+  id: root
+
+  property bool isOpen: false
